* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
* SIPM_60035_PULSE - Transient/Pulse Analysis Model
* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
* Use for:
* - TIA design
* - Pulse shaping testing
* - Signal chain simulation
* - Timing analysis
*
* Pins:
* K = Cathode (connect to +29V bias)
* A = Anode (connect to TIA inverting input)
*
* Note: Add external I_GAMMA source to simulate photon events
*
* Usage:
* .include SIPM_60035_PULSE.lib
* XU1 K A SIPM_60035_PULSE
* I_GAMMA 0 A EXP(0 100u 1u 1n 1.1u 50n)
* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

.subckt SIPM_60035_PULSE K A

* ═══════════════════════════════════════
* Parameters
* ═══════════════════════════════════════
.param IDARK25 = 1u
.param CSIPM = 3400p
.param RSERIES = 100
.param VBR25 = 24.5
.param TCVBR = 21.5m
.param TCGAIN = -0.008
.param TCDCR = 10

* ═══════════════════════════════════════
* Temperature Calculations
* ═══════════════════════════════════════
.param VBR_T = {VBR25 + TCVBR * (TEMP - 25)}
.param GAIN_MULT = {1 + TCGAIN * (TEMP - 25)}
.param IDARK_T = {IDARK25 * PWR(2, (TEMP - 25) / TCDCR)}

* ═══════════════════════════════════════
* Circuit Elements
* ═══════════════════════════════════════

* Series resistance sits between the external Cathode and the internal junction
R_SERIES K JUNCTION {RSERIES * (1 + 0.004 * (TEMP - 25))}

* Junction capacitance is inside the device, behind the series resistor
C_SIPM JUNCTION A {CSIPM}

* DC leakage path (prevents floating nodes and helps SPICE math convergence)
R_LEAK JUNCTION A 1000Meg

* Dark current
G_DARK JUNCTION A VALUE={IDARK_T * V(JUNCTION,A) / 29}

.ends SIPM_60035_PULSE